00:07:59.140 --> 00:08:02.400
concerning its experimental medicine targeting bowel disease.

00:08:02.940 --> 00:08:05.980
This example shows the impact that binary outcomes

00:08:05.980 --> 00:08:08.760
from clinical studies can have on stock prices

00:08:08.760 --> 00:08:10.400
in a single trading session.

00:08:11.100 --> 00:08:12.700
