00:08:17.720 --> 00:08:20.340
Market participants should refrain from purchasing

00:08:20.340 --> 00:08:22.820
immediately after such a gap up in price.

00:08:22.820 --> 00:08:25.920
Instead, waiting for the price to retest

00:08:25.920 --> 00:08:29.240
the 20-day moving average offers a more measured approach

00:08:29.240 --> 00:08:30.720
to any potential entry.

00:08:31.260 --> 00:08:33.360
This method helps avoid chasing momentum

00:08:33.360 --> 00:08:35.180
without additional confirmation.

